OL,3,GNEWSAWeekly round-up: Five stories you
OL,4,Amay have missed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 80s who learned to read,
OL,7,Fan artist who painted the portrait of
OL,8,Fher cancer surgeon and Waitrose opening
OL,9,Fits headquarters' gym to the public all
OL,10,Ffeature among the most-popular stories
OL,11,Fin the south of England this week.
OL,13,FIn case you missed them, we have picked
OL,14,Ffive articles from the past seven days
OL,15,Facross Hampshire, the Isle of Wight,
OL,16,FDorset, Berkshire and Oxfordshire to
OL,17,Fkeep you up to date.
OL,19,FWaitrose has been given permission to
OL,20,Fopen its private sports and leisure
OL,21,Fclub to the general public.
